{
  "_doc": "Which tests a change needs (#1234; tools/test_select.py, docs/LAYOUT.md 'CI'). A PR runs 'core' plus the tests every rule matching a changed file names (globs on tests/test_*.gd, '@group' a group below, 'all' everything, [] nothing), plus the tests that name the file (its res:// path or class_name), plus a changed test itself. A file no rule matches runs everything. Main runs everything after the merge. Add a rule when a new folder or kind of file appears; keep the groups honest when a test moves into the valley. 'canary' (#1326): the whole mission runs and the save round trip, on every building, structure, blast, body, prop, people's-look and plugin change (people, the world and missions reach them through @missions) and on every merge-in that brings main's code, so a PR can't go green while breaking a mission.",
  "per_shard_seconds": 420,
  "max_shards": 8,
  "all_shards": 8,
